    "counter_basis": "Every counter is counted per season from NDBC station 46026's own observations, then averaged over the 30 of 30 seasons that observed at least one Oct-Jan UTC date — a season with no data is named in seasons_with_no_data and is never averaged in as a zero, and the number of seasons behind each counter is printed with it. Day counters count UTC dates; the counters' coverage cut is published in coverage_rule.",
    "method": "Days are counted on distinct UTC dates inside 1 Oct – 31 Jan; the threshold is met when the day's maximum reaches it. Gusts are NDBC peak 5- or 8-second speeds, sustained wind is the 8-minute average, in both cases as NDBC defines them (quoted in units_page_quotes)."
